  "glyphAtlasContext": "Original default-font glyphs observed after stable native tab frames. Every glyph is rendered in a fitting title before observation. Independent observer-disabled launch has identical decoded RGBA pixels. Panel layout uses original Screen menu texture; supplied content is web composition."
